  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIGNITY - Danish Institute Against Torture - A World Without Torture 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection and Promotion of Human Rights</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme delivers capacity development of civil society actors and public authorities in developing countries in Africa, to help prevent torture and violence and rehabilitate traumatized victims. Advocacy efforts under the programme are focused on international norms with relevance in developing countries with direct applicability in programme activities on the ground, while research and knowledge production is focused on documenting and disseminating best practices and knowledge-based methods of effective prevention and rehabilitation in the context of developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
